 make an agreement  with the minor parties or independents  in order to govern  analysts say that prospect is highly  likely i'd be surprised if on saturday  night we know a clear winner from either  the major parties  i think we'll be looking for a count  several days afterwards the polls in  australia open on saturday sarah clark  al jazeera sydney australia
 

